// A job poll accepts an auto id.
// A digit id still polls. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE poll ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG poll law

IMPULSE poll 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "poll" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
